# Copy this file to .envrc to enter the devshell with direnv and nix-direnv.
# Nix reads pins.env when it evaluates the devshell. Watch it, so that the
# devshell loads again when a pin changes. nix-direnv checks the watched
# files when use flake runs, so watch it first. source_up_if_exists also
# loads the .envrc of a parent directory, if there is one.
source_up_if_exists
watch_file pins.env
use flake
